# Nix build outputs (created by `nix build`, `nix-build`, `nixos-rebuild`).
# These are convenience symlinks dropped into the working directory on every
# build — point to the active system/home-manager generation in /nix/store.
# They have no place in version control.
result
result-*

# Stashed diffs from in-flight migrations (see .stashes/).
# Currently holds home-manager-WIP.patch from the nix migration.
.stashes/
